B.aw7=new A.cA("What is AI Hand Analysis?","In the Hand Replayer, tap the AI chip to get a full coaching breakdown of a recorded hand. The analysis covers pre-flop decisions, post-flop play, sizing tells, and specific spots where you may have deviated from optimal lines \u2014 with actionable suggestions.")
B.awh=new A.cA("What is AI Session Analysis?","From a session detail view, tap Analyze to get an AI summary of your overall session performance. The analysis looks at your logged stats, notes, and context to identify patterns, tilt indicators, and areas of focus for your next session.")
